Package: wayland-protocols
Version: @DEB_WAYLANDPROTOCOLS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wayland.freedesktop.org
Description: Wayland protocol extension definitions
 A collection of additional Wayland protocols (xdg-shell, linux-dmabuf,
 viewporter, presentation-time and more) as XML, plus the wayland-protocols
 pkg-config file. Architecture-independent data consumed by clients and
 compositors at their build time.
